{%- comment -%}
  2026-10-04 (AI-readiness audit: "no dateModified"). WebPage node for the
  homepage. dateModified = publish date of the newest piece in the automatic
  «new-in» collection, i.e. the last time the homepage product rails really
  changed. It is NOT a deploy date or today's date (llms.txt tells agents not to
  infer freshness from deploys); if new-in is empty the property is left out.
  name/description must stay identical to <title> and the meta description at
  the top of this file.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign lb_home_mod_ts = 0
  assign lb_home_modified = ''
  for p in collections['new-in'].products limit: 12
    assign lb_ts = p.published_at | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    if lb_ts > lb_home_mod_ts
      assign lb_home_mod_ts = lb_ts
      assign lb_home_modified = p.published_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
    endif
  endfor
-%}
